# Blocklist refresh every six hours.
#
# Weekly was too rare for lists that move daily: a name added upstream on
# Thursday would not reach the device until the following Wednesday. The
# sources are a few megabytes and the update is atomic, with a shrink guard
# and an automatic rollback if unbound refuses the result.
0 */6 * * * root /usr/local/sbin/gatebsd-adblock-update.sh
